From 50882bc56ec15e0c02a2589677f41285763340fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Eden (Doris) build" <doris@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:04:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] turnip (Doris): time every GPU operation (sampled), report
 GPU clock/load/temperatures; lock render modes sooner

- u_trace: a Doris hook (U_TRACE_TYPE_DORIS) that hands each range event to the driver, and a
  per-trace switch so only some command buffers record tracepoints.
- tu_doris: for Eden only, 3 s of every 10 s every command buffer is traced; each window's GPU
  time is split into render passes (5+ draws, 1-4, none), uploads, downloads, image copies,
  blits, clears, buffer copies, compute, LRZ and the time between operations, plus what inside
  render passes takes the time and the 20 biggest groups; every 10 s the GPU clock and load
  (sampled every second) and battery, GPU and CPU temperatures. All in apex_doris.txt.
- autotune (profiled): lock a render pass's mode after 10 samples per mode and 10 s (was 15 and
  30 s) and for passes from 0.15 ms (was 1 ms), so passes that are clearly faster in one mode stop
  trying the other.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
